# An application with a positional argument, which is not supported.
#
#   ⟦ a ↦ ⟦ x ↦ ∅, φ ↦ ξ.x ⟧, foo ↦ Φ.a(⟦ Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A ⟧) ⟧
#
# The script below is printed by `phino sodg` 0.0.167, while 0.0.169
# refuses to print positional arguments.

F c0 a foo
F c1 x φ
D c2 c1 x
P c1 φ c2
P c0 a c1
D c3 c0 a
F c4
Δ c4 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A
A c5 c3 α0 c4
P c0 foo c5
